Package: numa
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: aarch64_cortex-a53
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: numa-openwrt
Description: Portable DNS resolver (upstream numa), static musl build.
 Built from @UPSTREAM_TAG@ (@UPSTREAM_COMMIT@) plus the mimalloc-on-musl
 overlay (PR #395, @MIMALLOC_HEAD@). Installs the binary and a procd service.
 The config is generated on the router with `numa-ctl gen-config`; nothing is
 started on install.
